      verifiedQuoteSource: 'Brown v. Board opinion text via National Archives and Oyez.',
      sensitiveClaimsReviewed: 'Retaliation against plaintiffs, Prince Edward County school closures, and multi-case consolidation reviewed against NPS and NARA.',
